{
  "slug": "claude-code-music",
  "name": "Claude Code Music",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Intelligent coding DJ for Claude Code. Adjusts Spotify music based on your coding mood, activity, and preferences. Includes /music commands (focus, hype, chill, debug, refactor, flow), automatic mood detection from prompts, audio TTS announcements for time and task completions, session-start auto-play, and a status line showing the current song.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **2 commands** and **3 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `music` (Intelligent coding DJ — control Spotify music based on coding mood and activity)\n- **Commands** (2): `music-setup` (First-time setup wizard — authenticate Spotify, learn your taste, and configure your coding DJ), `music` (Control your coding DJ — play music matched to your coding mood)\n- **Hooks** (3): `0`, `1`, `2`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-code-music@claude-community` from `shdowofdeath/claude-code-music`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "hook": 3,
    "command": 2
  },
